    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SOPHIE: --and once again, I am here by myself, trying to do it all on my own without any help--\nREBECCA: Help? Is that your code word for making someone listen to you complain about your life all day?\nSOPHIE: Listen here, Rebecca Ann--",
      "REBECCA: Answer the question!\nSOPHIE: You’re not my doctor, you’re my daughter, why can’t you just be on my side for once--\nREBECCA: How about you be on Martin’s side, have you thought about that?",
      "SOPHIE: Martin. Honey. Come on now.\nREBECCA: Let’s go.\nSOPHIE: You two planned this! Didn’t you!\nREBECCA: Nobody planned anything, mom.",
      "REBECCA: Hey.\nEMMA: Did you take Martin?\nREBECCA: What?",
      "REBECCA: I found the obituary! All right?\nSOPHIE: Like those can’t be faked, listen to yourself, you sound crazy--"
    ]
